WEBVTT

00:11.940 --> 00:13.840
That boy is so hot!

00:13.840 --> 00:14.850
Is he a model?

00:14.850 --> 00:16.560
He's got really great skin, too.

00:16.560 --> 00:19.110
My hotness is on point again today.

00:19.110 --> 00:22.340
I'm hot, both smart and athletic,
and both beautiful and witty.

00:22.340 --> 00:25.600
Is there a more perfect man than me?

00:26.580 --> 00:28.510
Of course there's not!

01:59.710 --> 02:02.260
Of Course, My Mom

02:02.740 --> 02:07.860
Today's workout regimen consists of front
planks, plank leg raises, and push-ups.

02:07.860 --> 02:11.060
Welcome home, Maa-kun!

02:11.970 --> 02:14.070
Would you act your age for once, you old hag?!

02:15.450 --> 02:17.630
Owie...

02:17.630 --> 02:20.320
How old are you?
Would you give that up already?!

02:22.760 --> 02:27.200
Maa-kun, you dummy! I'm in the fifth grade!

02:27.200 --> 02:29.860
Huh? Are you still half-asleep?

02:31.330 --> 02:35.590
Oh, dear. Maa-kun, you know better
than to be mean to little girls.

02:35.590 --> 02:36.800
Huh?!

02:38.250 --> 02:42.610
You don't remember her?
She is Asae-neesan's little Haruka-chan.

02:42.610 --> 02:45.260
Aunt... Asae?

02:45.540 --> 02:49.100
Yes. Haruka-chan is your cousin, Maa-kun.

02:49.100 --> 02:51.200
Has it been about a year
since you last saw each other?

02:51.200 --> 02:52.480
Uh-huh...

02:52.480 --> 02:54.110
Haruka?

02:54.110 --> 02:57.270
Haruka? I've heard that name before.

02:57.270 --> 03:01.410
Oh, yeah. That was right around
the time I finally got skinny.

02:58.220 --> 03:01.410
Thank you all for gathering here today.

03:01.410 --> 03:06.400
Eat plenty, drink plenty and enjoy yourselves!

03:08.800 --> 03:09.830
What?

03:10.120 --> 03:12.210
Masamune-oniichan!

03:13.710 --> 03:15.670
Oh, she's that pudgy little pudding!

03:17.790 --> 03:20.580
Man, you sure do look a lot like the loli hag.

03:20.580 --> 03:23.680
I mean... You sure have grown in a year! Yeah!

03:23.680 --> 03:25.140
Onii-chan!

03:25.140 --> 03:28.100
Why did you make Mom cry again?

03:28.820 --> 03:30.160
Wait, no! She's not—

03:30.160 --> 03:33.640
She's not what? You horrible son!

03:33.640 --> 03:38.230
Oh, Masamune-kun and Chinatsu-chan.
I see you're as close as ever.

03:44.700 --> 03:46.230
Auntie?

03:46.230 --> 03:49.540
I wish I could've had an older
brother for Haruka, too.

03:49.540 --> 03:52.300
You've still got time, Nee-san.

03:52.980 --> 03:55.670
You think so?
Maybe I'll give it another try.

03:55.670 --> 03:58.420
I'll be cheering you on.
Right, Haruka-chan?

03:58.420 --> 04:00.660
You can do it, Mommy!

04:00.660 --> 04:04.130
Just how are you going to do that?

04:04.810 --> 04:06.670
Guess they really are sisters.

04:07.130 --> 04:09.560
Seriously, though, they all
look way too much alike.

04:09.560 --> 04:12.030
Is our hag some kind of monster?

04:14.060 --> 04:15.840
Come over here for a sec!

04:15.840 --> 04:17.800
What is it, Chinatsu-chan?

04:28.680 --> 04:30.350
Here, change into these.

04:33.880 --> 04:35.310
Nice.

04:38.320 --> 04:39.940
Very nice.

04:42.560 --> 04:44.640
So cute!

04:46.080 --> 04:47.820
This is the best!

04:54.310 --> 04:55.840
Come on, now.

04:56.700 --> 04:58.740
I can't let this continue.

04:58.740 --> 04:59.940
So cute!

05:02.350 --> 05:05.400
Very nice! Why don't you
two get a little closer?

05:05.400 --> 05:07.240
Very nice!

05:09.290 --> 05:11.040
Wait, is she calling the cops?!

05:12.180 --> 05:13.120
Sorry for the wait!

05:13.120 --> 05:14.120
Auntie, wait!

05:21.770 --> 05:23.090
Wh-Who are you?!

05:23.090 --> 05:25.510
Oh, come on, now! It's your Auntie Asae!

05:25.510 --> 05:26.450
You lie!

05:26.450 --> 05:29.480
Please. I just got a little serious.

05:29.480 --> 05:31.480
Serious? What does "serious" even mean?!

05:31.480 --> 05:32.660
Serious about what?!

05:32.660 --> 05:36.070
Asae-neesan, you should have
Chinatsu-chan take your picture, too.

05:36.070 --> 05:37.990
That was exactly my intention!

05:37.990 --> 05:40.210
Yay! We all match!

05:40.210 --> 05:43.190
It's amazing what you can do with makeup.

05:43.190 --> 05:45.650
Makeup? This is makeup?!

05:46.000 --> 05:49.250
Does that mean our loli hag also
looks like that because of makeup,

05:49.250 --> 05:50.540
and she's actually...

05:51.760 --> 05:54.290
Women are terrifying!
I don't even want to think about that!

05:54.290 --> 05:57.730
Onii-chan, you dummy. Mom is all natural.

05:57.730 --> 05:58.880
Right?

05:58.880 --> 06:00.750
Wh-What?!

06:01.100 --> 06:03.680
That's terrifying in its own right!

06:10.430 --> 06:13.760
So, which one is your real mom?

06:15.300 --> 06:16.500
Is it me?

06:16.500 --> 06:17.800
It's me, of course!

06:17.800 --> 06:19.100
It's me, duh!

06:19.100 --> 06:21.140
It's me!

06:21.140 --> 06:22.260
Come on, Maa-kun!

06:22.260 --> 06:23.980
I'm telling you, it's me!

06:22.260 --> 06:23.980
Look at me!

06:25.610 --> 06:26.980
Please, no!

06:31.130 --> 06:32.610
I'm so tired.

06:35.600 --> 06:40.280
Um... You see, Maa-kun,
I wanted to be your girlfriend,

06:40.280 --> 06:42.340
so I tried really hard to grow bigger.

06:42.340 --> 06:43.080
Huh?

06:43.380 --> 06:45.810
Cousins can get married.

06:45.810 --> 06:49.700
You've got good taste. I'll give you that.

06:49.700 --> 06:52.120
But someone else already has my heart.

06:52.120 --> 06:53.800
Oh...

06:54.180 --> 06:56.990
Whoops... I was a bit too straightforward.

06:57.960 --> 07:02.270
Well, if things don't work out,
I get to be next, okay?

07:02.270 --> 07:03.260
Huh?

07:04.310 --> 07:07.630
The women of the Makabe
family sure are tough.

07:09.800 --> 07:11.790
You're the last person who should say that!

07:15.650 --> 07:18.660
Tsunade Island, Once More.

07:20.480 --> 07:22.420
This feels great, doesn't it?

07:22.420 --> 07:25.380
The scent of the salt air is so rich
that it's almost suffocating.

07:25.660 --> 07:28.530
I didn't think I'd be able
to come back this year.

07:28.530 --> 07:32.970
We must thank Aki-sama
for inviting us over again.

07:32.970 --> 07:36.320
Yeah! I'm sure it'll be a lot of fun again!

07:36.320 --> 07:38.600
We'll be there soon, so get ready.

07:38.600 --> 07:39.810
Okay.

07:41.320 --> 07:44.310
Welcome to Tsunade Island!

07:44.310 --> 07:46.690
We're happy to have you again this year!

07:47.590 --> 07:49.340
Hello, Yuisaki-san.

07:49.340 --> 07:52.660
Oh, I see you're as cute as ever, cutie boy!

07:52.660 --> 07:54.720
"Cutie boy"...

07:54.720 --> 07:57.840
Welcome to Aki-sama and the rest, as well.

07:57.840 --> 07:58.850
Hello!

07:58.850 --> 08:02.660
I may be "the rest,"
but thank you for having us.

08:02.660 --> 08:05.670
Oh? Where's the fucking
refreshing boy from last year?

08:06.940 --> 08:08.130
Ah...

08:08.130 --> 08:09.410
Oh?

08:09.980 --> 08:11.730
Did they break up? Separate?

08:11.730 --> 08:14.130
Bye-bye my love?
Something definitely happened!

08:14.130 --> 08:15.590
Ahem.

08:15.890 --> 08:17.800
Get a hold of yourself, Aki-sama.

08:17.800 --> 08:21.740
There are plenty of good men
other than that fucking boy.

08:21.740 --> 08:25.160
Now, hit me with any venting or anything
awful you want to say about him!

08:25.160 --> 08:26.820
Indeed...

08:26.820 --> 08:29.220
It really is too bad about Masamune-kun.

08:29.220 --> 08:30.950
If only <i>that</i> hadn't happened...

08:30.950 --> 08:31.830
"That"?

08:31.830 --> 08:34.000
Was the reason infidelity? DV?

08:34.000 --> 08:35.200
Both.

08:35.200 --> 08:37.010
Oh, my stars! My, oh, my, oh, my!

08:37.010 --> 08:40.030
Who did he cheat with? Who did he hit?

08:40.030 --> 08:42.160
Himself... and himself.

08:42.160 --> 08:42.910
Huh?

08:43.430 --> 08:47.330
He's such an idiot.
He's the worst idiot who ever lived.

08:49.290 --> 08:51.140
I'm on top of my game again today!

08:51.140 --> 08:53.220
Everything about me is in perfect symmetry.

08:53.220 --> 08:55.830
I look beautiful walking or sitting.

08:55.830 --> 08:59.560
Not to mention my hotness
is as blinding as the sun.

08:59.560 --> 09:01.540
I am truly perfec—

09:04.200 --> 09:05.260
What...?

09:07.830 --> 09:10.530
He was so enamored by his reflection
that he crashed into a street lamp?

09:10.530 --> 09:12.570
He actually bled? And got a concussion?

09:12.570 --> 09:15.060
How self-loving and narcissistic can he be?!

09:15.060 --> 09:17.410
He is the biggest fool who's ever lived!

09:17.780 --> 09:20.930
Ah, so that's why he
couldn't come on this trip.

09:20.930 --> 09:22.500
Oh...

09:23.530 --> 09:29.150
I mean... Oh, I hope he
gets back on his feet soon.

09:30.000 --> 09:32.940
What? As if I want anything to do with him.

09:32.940 --> 09:36.280
In that case, I'll gladly
take him off your hands.

09:36.280 --> 09:37.600
Me, too.

09:37.600 --> 09:40.860
Y-You two can't even tell when I'm joking?!

09:40.860 --> 09:42.790
Oh, I thought you were quite serious.

09:44.240 --> 09:48.450
Come on! Just try on this
bikini for a second!

09:48.450 --> 09:51.070
No!

09:51.980 --> 09:58.050
Makabe-kun, how could you
leave me alone like this?!

10:01.300 --> 10:04.100
I'm so sure he'd look cute in it.

10:04.100 --> 10:05.280
Too bad.

10:05.280 --> 10:08.110
It's not as if I don't understand how you feel...

10:09.610 --> 10:10.880
Yes?

10:11.320 --> 10:12.690
Are you two ready?

10:12.690 --> 10:14.510
Yes, anytime.

10:19.370 --> 10:20.840
What?

10:20.840 --> 10:23.520
Whoa, what happened?
Did you finally hit puberty?

10:23.520 --> 10:26.560
That's right. I'm not my old self anymore.

10:32.840 --> 10:36.050
Wow, it's such a nice day today.

10:36.700 --> 10:39.920
T-Today is quite amusing.

10:40.800 --> 10:42.930
Something came rolling toward me.

10:50.660 --> 10:52.700
Y-Yoshino?

10:52.700 --> 10:54.560
Yes, Aki-sama?

10:54.560 --> 10:57.980
I'm hungry. Could you bring
me something to eat?

10:58.340 --> 11:01.420
Please prepare your own meal.

11:04.440 --> 11:07.120
Yoshino's gotten quite a bit bolder.

11:44.140 --> 11:45.420
Yoshi—

11:46.460 --> 11:47.760
What is it?

11:47.760 --> 11:49.500
Never mind.

11:50.330 --> 11:51.220
Yes?

11:58.030 --> 12:01.180
You should start brushing from the ends.

12:03.800 --> 12:05.520
Hi, hi!

12:05.520 --> 12:06.920
Thank you for having us over.

12:06.920 --> 12:07.530
What?

12:09.350 --> 12:11.780
What do you mean, "what?"
We're having a girls' night!

12:11.780 --> 12:14.040
Talking into the wee hours
of the morning is a must!

12:14.040 --> 12:16.740
We came all the way to the ocean!
And it's nighttime!

12:16.740 --> 12:17.910
That makes no sense.

12:17.910 --> 12:21.360
This calls for sweets
and relationship stories.

12:21.360 --> 12:25.060
Yeah! Relationship stories!
And things like what our types are...

12:26.550 --> 12:29.780
Setting that aside...
Maybe we should talk about some troubles

12:29.780 --> 12:32.180
we can finally bring up now.

12:32.180 --> 12:37.060
Wh-What? I'm fine with talking about
relationship things or any advice you'd need!

12:38.780 --> 12:41.040
Since we're all here, we should...

12:41.040 --> 12:42.360
We should...?

12:42.360 --> 12:43.470
Study.

12:45.800 --> 12:47.060
Yeah...

12:47.060 --> 12:48.710
That'd be best.

12:48.710 --> 12:49.780
Wha—

12:53.350 --> 12:55.300
You were actually serious?

12:55.300 --> 12:58.590
I mean, we're third-years now.

12:58.590 --> 13:00.900
We have to prepare for entrance exams.

13:00.900 --> 13:02.500
Let's start with kanji drills.

13:02.500 --> 13:03.550
Hey!

13:04.240 --> 13:06.840
There isn't enough alcohol, damn it!

13:07.270 --> 13:10.400
What are y'all being so buddy-buddy for?

13:10.400 --> 13:12.020
Oh, I see.

13:12.020 --> 13:15.480
I can't be considered a girl anymore
because I've bazongaed into my thirties?

13:15.480 --> 13:17.280
This old hag is trying way too hard?

13:17.280 --> 13:20.500
Asking for a ring for my birthday
present was too overbearing?

13:20.500 --> 13:22.260
A beef bowl is more than enough?!

13:22.260 --> 13:23.170
Help...

13:23.170 --> 13:25.610
Shut your dumbass mouth!

13:26.730 --> 13:28.600
Oh, I'm aware.

13:28.600 --> 13:31.510
Love is just an illusion.
It's all a misunderstanding.

13:31.510 --> 13:34.830
Some people just wake up from
the dream faster than others!

13:36.320 --> 13:38.540
Hey! Aki! Sama!

13:39.020 --> 13:40.500
You understand, don't you?

13:40.500 --> 13:44.210
You only went out with that
hot boy because he's cute.

13:44.210 --> 13:46.010
You wouldn't have done it if he were a fatty!

13:47.690 --> 13:49.320
How about you? Would you date a fatty?

13:49.320 --> 13:51.640
Er, um...

13:51.640 --> 13:54.440
I'd have no issue as long as they were healthy.

13:54.440 --> 13:56.240
I'd still go out with them.

13:57.180 --> 13:57.980
You there!

13:58.350 --> 14:00.530
You averted your eyes just now, didn't you?

14:00.530 --> 14:03.520
You only like attractive people,
don't you?! You terrifying child!

14:07.980 --> 14:10.280
I'd love to hear what you'd have to say.

14:10.280 --> 14:11.410
Agreed!

14:14.440 --> 14:16.620
You terrifying child!

14:20.660 --> 14:23.340
Makabe-kun, save me...

14:55.030 --> 14:56.190
Hello?

14:56.190 --> 14:57.830
So, how are you doing?

14:57.830 --> 14:59.460
Okay, I guess.

14:59.460 --> 15:00.660
How are things over there?

15:00.660 --> 15:04.090
Fine. We're having fun.

15:04.410 --> 15:06.520
It's not as though I have to worry about

15:06.520 --> 15:09.800
how you're holding up,
or if you'll run into another pole.

15:10.150 --> 15:13.010
It's a very nice feeling.

15:14.820 --> 15:16.210
So you're lonely?

15:21.360 --> 15:25.540
Of course I'm lonely, you dummy.

15:29.690 --> 15:33.200
Cinderella After Twelve

15:37.050 --> 15:38.660
Onee-chan.

15:39.140 --> 15:41.820
Here. Gifts from Tsunade Island.

15:42.690 --> 15:46.310
Oh, right. Thanks. Did you have fun?

15:46.310 --> 15:47.550
Somewhat.

15:47.550 --> 15:51.360
I see. Don't you have the day off today?

15:51.360 --> 15:54.050
Your trip to Tsunade Island
counted as work, didn't it?

15:55.000 --> 15:59.100
I mean, I can understand that you
feel more comfortable wearing that outfit.

16:08.770 --> 16:10.660
Pick whatever you like and try it on.

16:10.660 --> 16:11.470
Huh?

16:18.750 --> 16:21.810
This is way too mature for me.
It won't look good.

16:21.810 --> 16:23.120
What are you talking about?

16:23.410 --> 16:26.080
We're sisters. Of course it'll look good on you.

16:35.860 --> 16:37.260
I don't think...

16:37.260 --> 16:39.150
Not quite right, huh?

16:42.100 --> 16:43.020
Hold on.

16:46.010 --> 16:47.460
Onee-chan...

16:47.460 --> 16:48.510
I know.

16:49.650 --> 16:53.900
Stay perfectly still.
Otherwise, you'll see blood.

17:19.820 --> 17:22.520
We should probably trim your bangs a bit.

17:32.060 --> 17:32.990
Here.

17:39.320 --> 17:40.380
There.

17:44.000 --> 17:45.710
There we go.

17:48.750 --> 17:50.790
Th-This is torture.

17:50.790 --> 17:53.710
And you're all done.
You can open your eyes now.

18:02.720 --> 18:05.570
I guess we can't do much about you
looking like an errand girl,

18:05.570 --> 18:09.920
but today's your day off,
so go do something for yourself.

18:09.920 --> 18:10.860
Huh?

18:11.530 --> 18:12.430
Off you go.

18:25.120 --> 18:28.150
Since I was always doing whatever
Aki-sama needed me to do,

18:28.150 --> 18:30.960
I never got to carry a tiny purse like this.

18:32.710 --> 18:36.920
I always wore flat shoes so that
I could rush to her side at any time.

18:39.640 --> 18:40.890
I never did my nails, either.

18:49.770 --> 18:51.200
Welcome.

19:08.670 --> 19:10.010
It's sweet.

19:10.010 --> 19:11.900
Is it to your liking?

19:19.540 --> 19:22.830
I wonder why I can't find this fun.

19:26.480 --> 19:28.680
Thank you!

19:28.680 --> 19:29.480
That was nice.

19:29.480 --> 19:31.380
Yeah, how fun!

19:31.680 --> 19:32.670
Let's go over there.

19:32.670 --> 19:33.590
Sure.

19:34.320 --> 19:35.780
Oh, right.

19:35.780 --> 19:38.230
Because when I finally let myself be selfish,

19:38.230 --> 19:41.600
I still wasn't able to get
the one thing that I wanted.

19:56.580 --> 19:57.630
Balloons!

19:57.630 --> 19:59.390
I'll go get you one!

20:02.760 --> 20:04.760
I-I'm sorry!

20:16.400 --> 20:17.440
You can have it.

20:19.550 --> 20:20.780
Thank you!

20:37.470 --> 20:39.120
Oh, sorry.

21:01.130 --> 21:04.680
Did you see her? She was super cute!

21:04.680 --> 21:05.650
Huh? Where?

21:06.070 --> 21:07.460
I don't think I saw her.

21:12.010 --> 21:13.870
Sorry, Onee-chan.

21:14.160 --> 21:17.670
It's fine, but are you sure you
want to come back already?

21:17.670 --> 21:18.430
Yeah.

21:20.000 --> 21:22.340
Honestly, what am I going to do with you?

21:22.340 --> 21:24.830
But it was a little bit fun.

21:24.830 --> 21:29.730
I had been wanting to be
prettier... on my own.

21:29.730 --> 21:30.950
Really?

21:30.950 --> 21:31.680
Yeah.

21:31.680 --> 21:33.560
So you're finally getting serious?

21:34.100 --> 21:37.270
I'll become prettier, be a better woman...

21:37.270 --> 21:38.710
Yup, yup...

21:38.710 --> 21:41.120
...make them fall for me, and then dump them.

21:41.120 --> 21:41.820
What?

21:43.740 --> 21:44.990
Just kidding.

21:48.860 --> 21:50.170
It's Aki-sama.

21:55.180 --> 21:58.120
Who knew she had that side to her?

22:25.320 --> 22:33.580
The town and the seasons seem to breeze right by me

22:40.580 --> 22:48.090
I close my eyes and dive deeper into the sea of my heart

22:48.090 --> 22:53.850
And deeper, deeper,

23:28.300 --> 23:40.400
Even as time passes, I don't think my feelings will change
